# FACT · space BINDS, case RESOLVES — how an unquoted C4QL run knows where it ends (2026-08-10)

Read off three of his own TAG examples, minted the same day. This is my reading, offered back for
correction — [ours — revisable] throughout. What is NOT mine is the material quoted verbatim.

## The three specimens

  1  [(TAG)TYPE(intern:["type","TYPE"],plural:["types","TYPES"]): "(virtual) a TERM (for C4: tag)
     or word representing a means of persistence and/or transport encoding (for C4, usually: both)"
     as VIRTUAL from KEYS toward TAXONOMY]
  2  [(TAG)kind: representing … [[ … ]] as VIRTUAL from KEYS into HOST offering TAXONOMY]
  3  [(TAG)theme: (virtual)taxonomy collection or reusable presentation typically providing
